  "full_response": "Here’s a **connection string reference** with examples for **MongoDB, PostgreSQL, Redis, and MSSQL**:\n\n---\n\n### **1. MongoDB**\n**Format:**\n`mongodb://[username:password@]host1[:port1][,...hostN[:portN]][/[defaultauthdb][?options]]`\n\n**Examples:**\n- Basic (no auth):\n  `mongodb://localhost:27017/mydb`\n- With authentication:\n  `mongodb://user:pass@localhost:27017/mydb`\n- Replica set:\n  `mongodb://user:pass@host1:27017,host2:27017/mydSet=rs0`\n- With TLS/SSL:\n  `mongodb://user:pass@localhost:27017/mydb?tls=true`\n\n---\n\n### **2. PostgreSQL**\n**Format:**\n`postgresql://[user[:password]@][netloc][:port][/dbname][?param1=value1&...]`\n\n**Examples:**\n- Basic:\n  `postgresql://localhost:5432/mydb`\n- With authentication:\n  `postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/mydb`\n- With SSL:\n  `postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/mydb?sslmode=require`\n- Connection pooling:\n  `postgresql://user:pass@localhost:5432/mydb?pool_size=10`\n\n---\n\n### **3. Redis**\n**Format:**\n`redis://[username:password@]host[:port][/db_number]`\n\n**Examples:**\n- Basic (default port 6379):\n  `redis://localhost:6379`\n- With password:\n  `redis://:password@localhost:6379`\n- With username/password (Redis 6+ ACL):\n  `redis://user:pass@localhost:6379`\n- Select database (e.g., DB 1):\n  `redis://:pass@localhost:6379/1`\n- TLS/SSL:\n  `rediss://:pass@localhost:6379` (note `rediss://` for SSL)\n\n---\n\n### **4. Microsoft SQL Server (MSSQL)**\n**Format:**\n`Server=host;[Database=db;]User Id=user;",
